  "statuteText": "12-O:24 Economic Development Strategy and Plan. –\n\nThe division of economic development, with input and assistance from the council of partner agencies established under RSA 12-O:7 and other public and private organizations with whom it chooses to work, shall develop a rolling 10-year economic development strategy and operating plan."
